math_native.rdn
Copyright (c) 2023-2026 Ray Den
SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT

Purpose:
Cross-platform wrapper over the native math module.

Loading behavior:
This module chooses the shared-library suffix from __sharedlib_ext and loads:
../nativelibs/math(.so|.dylib|.dll)

Exports:
- sqrt : native square root
- powf : native floating-point power

Stack contracts:
number sqrt call -> result
base exponent powf call -> result

Examples:
"./libs/math_native.rdn" load
4 sqrt call print
"\n" print
2 0.5 powf call print
*]

"../nativelibs/math" __sharedlib_ext to_string swap pop append loadnative

sqrt defun
    sqrtOf call
end

powf defun
    powerOf call
end
